Column name: name Type: STRING Description: Name of station
Column name: latitude Type: FLOAT64 Description: Latitude
Column name: longitude Type: FLOAT64 Description: Longitude
Column name: dockcount Type: INT64 Description: Number of total docks at station
Column name: landmark Type: STRING Description: City (San Francisco, Redwood City, Palo Alto, Mountain View, San Jose)
Column name: installation_date Type: DATE Description: Original date that station was installed. If station was moved, it is noted below.
